sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Issuing Institution Admin
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant Contract as Smart Contract (Solidity)
    participant Chain as Hardhat EVM
    participant DB as Relational Database

    Admin->>UI: Click Revoke on Certificate Registry
    UI->>Admin: Prompt Confirmation Modal
    Admin->>UI: Confirm Revocation
    UI->>API: POST /api/certificates/{id}/revoke (JWT Bearer)
    API->>API: Ensure calling admin belongs to issuing institution
    API->>Contract: revokeCertificate(certId) signed by Issuer Private Key
    Contract->>Contract: Verify caller == originalIssuer
    Contract->>Contract: Verify certificate exists and revoked == false
    Contract->>Chain: Set cert.revoked = true
    Chain-->>Contract: Emit CertificateRevoked
    Contract-->>API: Transaction Receipt (txHash, blockNumber)
    API->>DB: Update cert.revoked = true & record REVOKE transaction
    API-->>UI: Return updated certificate status
    UI-->>Admin: Show REVOKED status badge
